<title>SINGAPORE: Causeway tops volume on 1 mln share cross.</title>
<headline>Causeway tops volume on 1 mln share cross.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading firm Causeway Investment Ltd topped the actives list early on Tuesday morning with a cross of one million shares at Singapore $1.45 per share, dealers said.</p>
<p>The off-market deal was one of a number of crosses reported in recent weeks. On August 7, Causeway denied rumours it was being taken over following a rash of similar deals.</p>
<p>By 0120 GMT, Causeway share stood at S$1.44, up three cents.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
